---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Financial planning"
  description="Financial planning for individuals and businesses in Centurion: life cover, retirement, investments, medical aid and employee benefits."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Financial planning</h1>
    <p>
      I look at the whole picture: what you have, what you owe, who depends on you, and what happens to all of it
      if you die or can't work. Then we fix the gaps, one at a time.
    </p>

    <h2>For you and your family</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Life, disability and dread-disease cover</li>
      <li>Retirement planning and investments</li>
      <li>Medical aid and gap cover</li>
      <li>Motor and household insurance</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>For your business</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Employee benefits and group life</li>
      <li>Buy-and-sell and key-person cover</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Objective advice across a range of providers, including Momentum and Sanlam.
    </p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/contact">Book a conversation</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
